--- !u!114 &114021183420624511
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1200305367956916}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 513
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 是的，当年天下难安，魔族猖獗。我希望幻雾阵可以用于模拟各种不同的修士，用于教导入阵者如何熟练使用门中的功法神通，以增加战斗经验，让门中弟子除魔卫道的同时还能保障自身安全。
